{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stuck in a Loop</strong> is a unique puzzle game where you don't control the character directly \u2014 you program it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each room you will encounter a puzzle. Analyze the environment, configure a limited set of instructions, and let the robot execute your plan in a <strong>loop</strong>. Success depends on your reasoning  and think ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the story, the challenges grow more intricate and the available instructions become more diverse \u2014 introducing conditionals and other programming-inspired mechanics. Every level is designed to test your logic without requiring any coding knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its carefully designed levels, <strong>Stuck in a Loop</strong> offers a fresh twist on puzzle-solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game crafted by a puzzle lover, for puzzle lovers.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3869190?t=1764704643","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3869190?t=1764704643","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869190/58bbea4eb512ee1777826b7fc20ca2c26cdd20de/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764704643","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869190/58bbea4eb512ee1777826b7fc20ca2c26cdd20de/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764704643","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stuck in a Loop</strong> is a unique puzzle game where you don't control the character directly \u2014 you program it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each room you will encounter a puzzle. Analyze the environment, configure a limited set of instructions, and let the robot execute your plan in a <strong>loop</strong>. Success depends on your reasoning  and think ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the story, the challenges grow more intricate and the available instructions become more diverse \u2014 introducing conditionals and other programming-inspired mechanics. Every level is designed to test your logic without requiring any coding knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its carefully designed levels, <strong>Stuck in a Loop</strong> offers a fresh twist on puzzle-solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game crafted by a puzzle lover, for puzzle lovers.</p>","developers":["FromGate"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869190/dc54adbaf9867554ebf4a63de572b18f586d6fe0/header.jpg?t=1764704643","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Stuck in a loop","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":true,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["FromGate"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","r